<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese retail sector improves in Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Portuguese retail sector improves in Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sales' outlook for the Portuguese retail sector in the first quarter of 1997 is better than a year ago, with a corresponding improvement in employment prospects, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Institute said that its indicators pointed to the improvement noted in the second half of 1996 having continued in January 1997.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
